%% Recon — streaming (real time), same rules as batch
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant BUS as Message bus
  participant R as recon-worker
  participant RR as Read replica
  participant PG as PostgreSQL primary

  BUS->>R: record-canonicalized(rule set, match key, commit LSN)
  R->>PG: INSERT processed_message ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING (dedupe) — same tx as the effect below
  R->>RR: wait for replay LSN, then point lookup of counterpart(s) by key_hash
  alt counterpart present
    R->>PG: claim or create group (owner token)
    R->>R: evaluate rules
    R->>PG: tx: new group version (MATCHED / MISMATCHED / DUPLICATE ...) + diffs + outbox
  else not yet
    R->>PG: tx: group PENDING with matching-window deadline + outbox
  end
  Note over R,PG: a later arrival or correction re-opens the group as a new version (history kept)
